」\n\n\n这距离 Muse 正式上线，仅仅过了 13 天。\n\nMeta 推出的个人 AI 助手 Muse", "published_at": "2026-09-22T04:01:13Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-3e258f11a53a.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-58e6c30724cf", "title": "You Need More Protein If You’re Working Hard in the Gym—Here’s How Much", "source": "GQ", "author": "Jennifer Heimlich", "url": "https://www.gq.com/story/you-need-more-protein-if-you-work-out-8", "image_url": "https://media.gq.com/photos/6626d64a028919a323375fe7/master/pass/protein.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "style", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["GQ", "Lifestyle", "en", "style", "text", "健身"], "excerpt": "Heading to the gym to lift a few weights can be a gateway drug to a whole wellness routine. Before you know it, you’re doing pre-workout mobility drills.", "published_at": "2026-09-22T10:58:28Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-58e6c30724cf.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5c9242879bee", "title": "The 6 Best Comedy Shows of 2026 So Far, Ranked", "source": "Collider", "author": "Jessica Nobleza", "url": "https://collider.com/best-comedy-shows-2026-so-far-ranked/", "image_url": "https://static0.colliderimages.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/widows-bay-1.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "film", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Collider", "Entertainment", "en", "film", "text", "搞笑"], "excerpt": "Published Sep 22, 2026, 7:03 AM EDT\n\nJessica is a young writer from Brisbane, Australia. An avid consumer and lover of all things Film and TV, you will never", "published_at": "2026-09-22T11:03:11Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5c9242879bee.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5dc131998993", "title": "Muse, Meta's extraordinarily privileged AI assistant, has a serious 0-day", "source": "Ars Technica", "author": "Dan Goodin", "url": "https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/09/muse-metas-extraordinarily-privileged-ai-assistant-has-a-serious-0-day/", "image_url": "https://cdn.arstechnica.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ai-agent-hacking-1152x648.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Ars Technica", "Tech", "en", "tech", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "Meta founder and CEO Mark Zuckerberg has gone to great lengths to hype the security of its new AI assistant Muse, claiming it is “built from the ground up for", "published_at": "2026-09-21T22:24:38Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5dc131998993.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-96d66f95b4be", "title": "软银借道债市为AI帝国输血，垃圾债市场迎来历史级考验", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782300", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/e584f405-4270-490c-a5de-89a5387b9398.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "社会话题"], "excerpt": "软银大规模债券发行，正成为债市检验投资者AI投资热情与风险承受能力的一场关键测试。\n\n\n9月22日，据彭博援引知情人士透露，软银集团此次债券发行已吸引逾200亿美元的初步投资意向，有望跻身史上规模最大的垃圾债交易之列。此次发行募资将主要用于支持软银对OpenAI的巨额投资，投资者正争相锁定可能创下纪录的高收益率。\n\n\n", "published_at": "2026-09-22T11:00:35Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-96d66f95b4be.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-974c3a6b8c56", "title": "Seth Meyers is joining an award-winning podcast for a live taping inside NYC’s Comedy Cellar this month", "source": "Secret NYC", "author": "Corey Fuller", "url": "https://secretnyc.co/seth-meyers-live-po