ontent_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Screen Rant", "en", "film", "text", "投资"], "excerpt": "House Of The Dragon Officially Switches Genres In Sky Of Fire\n\nPublished Sep 22, 2026, 6:21 AM EDT\n\nJames is a gaming writer from London who has spent", "published_at": "2026-09-22T10:21:55Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a582298ab3e2.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ad010f543cb5", "title": "零跑的新目标：从「小米」成为「苹果」", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370765", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/7e/8d/7e8d31b891e0883ea1269e3cbf76367f.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "这一次，零跑主动放弃了「第一」的位置，并表示将全力「争当第三」。\n\n\n在零跑 2026", "published_at": "2026-09-21T15:11:23Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ad010f543cb5.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ae131f2599ee", "title": "韩国对美投资协议首单确认：拟在得州建200亿美元燃气电厂，供电AI数据中心", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782293", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/da6961c0-5e01-4f13-9082-07e6fd842e43.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资"], "excerpt": "韩国对美大规模投资协议确认首个项目：拟在得克萨斯州投资建设一座价值逾200亿美元的燃气电厂，所发电力将主要供应当地AI数据中心和芯片工厂。\n\n\n9月22日，据路透社报道，韩国已确认该燃气电厂为对美投资协议的首个项目，同时正与美国就核电和液化天然气项目展开进一步磋商。韩国政府表示，相关投资仍需经过美国政府投资委员会审批，", "published_at": "2026-09-22T10:08:35Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ae131f2599ee.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-caa6e32ef6a7", "title": "光帆携手韶音，以 AI OS 破局单点功能内卷", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "艾 梵", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1681475?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/lark2pad-1790067268230-1.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n过去四个月，我们曾先后体验过两款「AI 耳机」：光帆 AI 全感穿戴设备和韶音 OpenFit 2 AI。\n\n\n前者给耳机装上摄像头，配上智能手表和能独立联网的耳机盒，试图让 AI 跟着人一起看、一起听；后者则沿着韶音熟悉的开放式耳机路线，接入录音、转写、总结和翻译功能，摇身一变成为了工作场景下的 AI", "published_at": "2026-09-22T10:10:26Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-caa6e32ef6a7.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-ddb9130feddd", "title": "“芯片网红”：AI算力瓶颈早已不是算力芯片，而是先进封装、互连延迟与存储层级", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782276", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/53839808-0d9a-47f1-ac2e-d04cbb5d4c51.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "当市场在为科技巨头数千亿美元的AI资本支出（Capex）能否回本而焦虑时，产业最前沿的硬件工程师们却在关注另一个更本质的命题：摩尔定律的经济学已经破产，算力竞赛的真正瓶颈，从来不在芯片本身，而是从“设计更快的芯片”变成了“控制从硅片到机架的物理堆栈”。\n\n近日，在知名科技播客Frictionless Podcast", "published_at": "2026-09-22T04:22:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-22T11:13:15Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ddb9130feddd.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-e4b1363a388d", "title": "黄仁勋：AI 时代，企业应该尽可能多付薪酬；宇树科技发布 Dex5-S 灵巧手；OpenAI 新模型 24 天解决 100+ 世界级数学难题 | 极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370768", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/3e/4b/3e4b3cf100df709edbfa4c760694ef6d.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category